Today is Saturday.
I am going to Marine Drive today.
This is my first big outing in South Mumbai.
I meet Asha in my building.
I tell her about my journey.
I ask, "Asha, how do I go there?"
She tells me the way.
She says, "Maya, you take your usual bus."
"Get down at a big junction."
"From there, go towards the new bus stop."
I ask, "Where is that bus stop?"
She explains, "First go straight from the junction."
"Then turn left."
I ask, "Should I turn right?"
She says, "No, do not turn right."
"Only turn left and walk straight."
"The bus from there will take you towards Marine Drive."
I thank Asha.
I step out for my bus now.
